  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F42D\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Saved from a wildcat
  _description: The [[d66a2c64-124c-4313-8911-f67c5e0e7b01|Tin Woodman]] saves her
    from a wildcat. In return her mice pull the sleeping [[d2eb523f-1396-4e40-91d2-4927aa29cf9b|Cowardly
    Lion]] out of the [[54a5f756-efe8-4ac6-a232-8cff167ed1f5|Deadly Poppy Field]]
    on a little wooden truck.
